      "root_cause": "core.checks._merge_schematic_nets folds internal nets (int_p, int_n, int_src) into port aliases, corrupting schematic net names",
      "workaround": "Custom LVS runner (custom_lvs.py) invokes Magic flattening + netgen directly, achieving a canonical netgen MATCH"
    },
