      "symptom": "Original sizing (nf=6/5/11/11/12) produced 32 DRC violations and LVS mismatches",
      "root_cause": "PathFinder auto-router congests at high finger counts and mis-assigns tail-net midpoint ports",
      "workaround": "Simplify all PMOS to nf=2 (W=4u, L=1u); cleared DRC and LVS while keeping all 4 primary specs within target"
